{"about_the_game":"Miner Clicker is a single-player clicking game and your primary task involves clicking to demolish mines. Your goal is to break the rocks, earn minerals, and accumulate wealth through investments.<br><br>The real-time market feature offers players to engage in dynamic trade of minerals. Face the exciting challenge of fluctuating market conditions: the strategy to buy low and sell high maximizes profits, yet it also bears the risk of potential losses. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844400/extras/f9f5347e6f8facd450857fe683d6f1c7.poster.avif?t=1772408804\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844400/extras/f9f5347e6f8facd450857fe683d6f1c7.webm?t=1772408804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844400/extras/f9f5347e6f8facd450857fe683d6f1c7.mp4?t=1772408804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Clicking rocks damages them, and once destroyed, you'll earn the associated minerals. With the wealth accumulated, you can invest in hiring miners who will tirelessly work on your behalf. These hired miners, each with specific attributes such as damage and efficiency rates, automatically strike the mines to extract resources for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844400/extras/226b2375e92e9f8c5169e9d1db449bcb.poster.avif?t=1772408804\" width=334 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844400/extras/226b2375e92e9f8c5169e9d1db449bcb.webm?t=1772408804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844400/extras/226b2375e92e9f8c5169e9d1db449bcb.mp4?t=1772408804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The ultimate goal is to amass a fortune and create your auto mining farm!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2844400?t=1772408804","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844400/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772408804","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844400/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772408804","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844400/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772408804","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Miner Clicker is a single-player clicking game and your primary task involves clicking to demolish mines. Your goal is to break the rocks, earn minerals, and accumulate wealth through investments.<br><br>The real-time market feature offers players to engage in dynamic trade of minerals. Face the exciting challenge of fluctuating market conditions: the strategy to buy low and sell high maximizes profits, yet it also bears the risk of potential losses. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844400/extras/f9f5347e6f8facd450857fe683d6f1c7.poster.avif?t=1772408804\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844400/extras/f9f5347e6f8facd450857fe683d6f1c7.webm?t=1772408804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844400/extras/f9f5347e6f8facd450857fe683d6f1c7.mp4?t=1772408804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Clicking rocks damages them, and once destroyed, you'll earn the associated minerals. With the wealth accumulated, you can invest in hiring miners who will tirelessly work on your behalf. These hired miners, each with specific attributes such as damage and efficiency rates, automatically strike the mines to extract resources for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844400/extras/226b2375e92e9f8c5169e9d1db449bcb.poster.avif?t=1772408804\" width=334 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844400/extras/226b2375e92e9f8c5169e9d1db449bcb.webm?t=1772408804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844400/extras/226b2375e92e9f8c5169e9d1db449bcb.mp4?t=1772408804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The ultimate goal is to amass a fortune and create your auto mining farm!","developers":["Penguven Arts"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844400/header.jpg?t=1772408804","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2844400/671392/d8d3e5ed7fb627b8f0e3c53c170744ce460b8554/1750946976/dash_av1.mpd?t=1710173026","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2844400/671392/d8d3e5ed7fb627b8f0e3c53c170744ce460b8554/1750946976/dash_h264.mpd?t=1710173026","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2844400/671392/d8d3e5ed7fb627b8f0e3c53c170744ce460b8554/1750946976/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1710173026","id":257006027,"name":"Miner Clicker","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257006027/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1710173026"}],"name":"Miner Clicker","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul 